     4751   RUN disable_UI.
     4752   PROCEDURE disable_UI :
     4753     HIDE FRAME Dialog-Frame.
     4754   END PROCEDURE.
     4755   PROCEDURE enable_UI :
     4756     DISPLAY Rs-object mark-num
     4757         WITH FRAME Dialog-Frame.
     4758     ENABLE b-quit B-sel B-mark B-add B-chg B-del B-gds b-price b-scal-grp B-hist
     4759            B-help B-on B-purg B-send b-ticket B-rum Rs-object B-attr BR-scales
     4760            mark-num
     4761         WITH FRAME Dialog-Frame.
     4762     VIEW FRAME Dialog-Frame.
     4763   END PROCEDURE.
